      "text": "Japan , a very favourit country .I have always a hope in my mind to visit the country ,Japan,  where my ancèstors  were in Japan. Maternal uncle of my grand father , S.C.KARR,  went to Japan to join the competetion of shooting in his young life and he won the impossible  cup .He won several silver cups & shields in his life . Once he won golden brief case in shooting competetion on Japan.He finally settled  in Japan . AND he accompanied his nephew named S.C GUPTA with him .Then , there families are at Japan.Several times we tried to contact them, but could not,as we have no knowledge ,where their families are.",
